<title>INDIA: India Apr-Oct steel output seen at 13.10 mln tonnes.</title>
<headline>India Apr-Oct steel output seen at 13.10 mln tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>India produced 13.10 million tonnes of finished steel in April-October 1996 against 11.17 million tonnes during the same period last year, a Steel Ministry statement said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>It said India exported 550,000 tonnes of finished steel during April-October compared to 446,000 tonnes in the same period last year.</p>
<p>India produced 1.69 million tonnes of pig iron during April-October against 1.58 million tonnes last year, the statement added.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11-301 2024</p>
</text>
